H. Synthesis
  Address coordinates are not decorations.  They are the derivative variable.
  In exact repo cases, unpaired/global scalar repairs fail; paired/addressed
  derivatives split the collision.  In external theorem families, the same
  mechanism appears as log derivatives, Weyl m-functions, J-fractions,
  Kocay matrices, activity expansions, trace formulas, and Hodge operators.
  Best next builds: LRC owner derivative, tournament n=7 paired deck, OCF
  noncommutative address projection, and unit-distance deletion-owner lab.
